From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: celenity <celenity@celenity.dev>
Date: Sun, 05 Jul 2026 20:19:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Application Services - Localize Maven

Adds mavenLocal() for standalone app-services builds (no mozconfig).

Note (Vantage): the mozconfig branch intentionally keeps using
GRADLE_MAVEN_REPOSITORIES (aliyun mirrors + local file repo) instead of
bare mavenLocal(), because mavenLocal() points at ~/.m2 which is empty
while the real local repo is build/.m2/repository. Using the subst list
avoids hitting repo.maven.apache.org / dl.google.com directly (blocked
in CN networks).

Signed-off-by: celenity <celenity@celenity.dev>
---
diff --git a/settings.gradle b/settings.gradle
index c891c8ac1..44df67926 100644
--- a/settings.gradle
+++ b/settings.gradle
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@ buildscript {
     if (!gradle.root.hasProperty("mozconfig")) {
         // in app-services
         repositories {
+            mavenLocal()
             mavenCentral()
         }
     } else {
-- 
